          "id": "7760694",
          "text": "Aprender es divertido.",
          "translation": "Учиться весело.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7760694 @Adelpa / #12687036 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7760694",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
