          "text": "¿Y a quién le dejo la casa?",
          "translation": "А кому я оставлю дом?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7410643 @arh / #7846467 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7410643",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dejo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9697258",
          "text": "Me dejo la piel en mi trabajo.",
          "translation": "Я вкалываю как проклятый на своей работе.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #9697258 @Ivanovb / #9697262 @Ivanovb (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9697258",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dejo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1801161",
          "text": "Eso se lo dejo a su imaginación.",
          "translation": "Я оставлю это вашему воображению.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1801161 @Shishir / #6941838 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1801161",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dejo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5412165",
          "text": "Si necesitas un bolígrafo te dejo uno.",
          "translation": "Если тебе нужна ручка, я дам.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5412165 @Shishir / #7575313 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5412165",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dejo-noun"
          ]
        }
