          "source": "Tatoeba #5765372 @Lalourquieta / #5765780 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5765372",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "conversación-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1122769",
          "text": "Tuvimos una buena conversación.",
