          "translation": "Итак, вы решились?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10794231 @Curro / #1458742 @vladb314 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10794231",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "decidido-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2049378",
          "text": "Han decidido no venir.",
          "translation": "Они решили не приходить.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2049378 @Shishir / #3233154 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2049378",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "decidido-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "994775",
          "text": "He decidido estudiar taquigrafía.",
          "translation": "Я решил учиться стенографии.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #994775 @hundo / #996605 @elsteris (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/994775",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "decidido-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5961186",
          "text": "No me he decidido aún.",
          "translation": "Я ещё не решил.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5961186 @Adelpa / #1574079 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5961186",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
