          "plural of dato",
          "data"
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "7028989",
          "text": "Verifique sus datos.",
          "translation": "Проверьте свои данные.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7028989 @Schuager / #7029024 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7028989",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "datos-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3390020",
          "text": "He analizado los datos.",
          "translation": "Я проанализировал данные.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3390020 @marcelostockle / #5563717 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3390020",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "datos-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7551113",
          "text": "Tenía datos de varias fuentes.",
          "translation": "У меня были данные из разных источников.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7551113 @arh / #7745188 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7551113",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "datos-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3106068",
          "text": "Los datos a menudo son incorrectos.",
          "translation": "Данные часто неверны.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3106068 @marcelostockle / #5286238 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3106068",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "datos-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1411123",
          "text": "Aún estamos analizando los datos restantes.",
          "translation": "Мы ещё анализируем оставшиеся данные.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1411123 @marcelostockle / #7210932 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1411123",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "datos-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "B1"
      ],
