          "source": "Tatoeba #2561180 @marcelostockle / #4909358 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2561180",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "llamadas-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1670055",
          "text": "Mi celular hace todo, menos llamadas.",
