          "to steal",
          "to draw (e.g., a card from an opponent in a game)",
          "to kidnap, abduct"
        ]
      },
      "gender": "m",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "1561589",
          "text": "Robar es malo.",
          "translation": "Воровать плохо.",
