            "marca-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "479878",
          "text": "Auldey es una marca china.",
          "translation": "\"Auldey\" — это китайская марка.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #479878 @Shishir / #478973 @Olya (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/479878",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "marca-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5661043",
          "text": "El termómetro marca treinta grados.",
          "translation": "Термометр показывает 30 градусов.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5661043 @arh / #5650117 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5661043",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "marca-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6882948",
          "text": "Tom solo lleva ropa de marca.",
          "translation": "Том носит только брендовую одежду.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6882948 @diegohn / #13633562 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6882948",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "marca-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3216053",
          "text": "Marca las palabras que no entiendas.",
          "translation": "Отметь слова, которые не понимаешь.",
