          "source": "Tatoeba #3015572 @marcelostockle / #3015813 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3015572",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "llamé-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5116294",
          "text": "Llamé de antemano.",
          "translation": "Я позвонил заранее.",
