          "source": "Tatoeba #989465 @hayastan / #1083926 @Katheriinne (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/989465",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "menor-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5017307",
          "text": "No tengo la menor idea.",
          "translation": "Не имею ни малейшего понятия.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5017307 @don_ramon / #2707065 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5017307",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "menor-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1993831",
          "text": "John es mi hermano menor.",
          "translation": "Джон - мой младший брат.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1993831 @marcelostockle / #885074 @aleph (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1993831",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
