          "translation": "Мы должны победить любой ценой.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1276104 @Coilet / #6386585 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1276104",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costa-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5613877",
          "text": "Tom vivió en la costa oeste.",
          "translation": "Том жил на западном побережье.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5613877 @saverius / #5615814 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5613877",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costa-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6795992",
          "text": "Vivían a costa de los demás.",
          "translation": "Они жили за счёт других.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6795992 @arh / #6796048 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6795992",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costa-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2968519",
          "text": "Ella vende conchas en la costa.",
          "translation": "Она продаёт морские раковины на берегу моря.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2968519 @marcelostockle / #2968695 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2968519",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costa-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5939245",
          "text": "Tom necesitaba dinero a toda costa.",
          "translation": "Тому любой ценой было нужно достать деньги.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5939245 @arh / #5974859 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5939245",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costa-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "B1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki es (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "spanish": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "costa",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": "costa"
