          "source": "Tatoeba #1804096 @marcelostockle / #6970087 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1804096",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "interés-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "562333",
          "text": "Ha perdido interés en la política.",
