          "source": "Tatoeba #2830280 @nesiax / #2830403 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2830280",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "teoría-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7420236",
          "text": "Conozco bien la teoría.",
