          "source": "Tatoeba #1386465 @marcelostockle / #4416752 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1386465",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "números-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3312306",
          "text": "Intercambiamos números de teléfono.",
          "translation": "Мы обменялись телефонами.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3312306 @gianich73 / #3314086 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3312306",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
