          "text": "Creemos en Dios.",
          "translation": "Веруем в Бога.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12767771 @Adelpa / #1580921 @corvard (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12767771",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "creemos-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2711377",
          "text": "Todos creemos en algo.",
          "translation": "Мы все во что-нибудь верим.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2711377 @ramonj / #2781674 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2711377",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "creemos-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "615570",
          "text": "Creemos en la democracia.",
          "translation": "Мы верим в демократию.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #615570 @Shishir / #877033 @afyodor (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/615570",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "creemos-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7747598",
          "text": "No creemos que sobreviva.",
          "translation": "Мы не думаем, что он выживет.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7747598 @arh / #7748370 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7747598",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "creemos-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11568718",
          "text": "Creemos en dioses diferentes.",
          "translation": "Мы верим в разных богов.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11568718 @carlosalberto / #11568760 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11568718",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "creemos-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
