          "source": "Tatoeba #8646130 @herchx / #4611602 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8646130",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "comprendo-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1677263",
          "text": "Gracias, ahora comprendo.",
          "translation": "Спасибо, теперь понятно.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1677263 @africanus / #3504015 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1677263",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "comprendo-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "755920",
          "text": "Yo comprendo tu lengua.",
          "translation": "Я понимаю твой язык.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #755920 @marcelostockle / #469124 @OlgaElwen (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/755920",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
