          "source": "Tatoeba #2268661 @hayastan / #3211804 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2268661",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "testigos-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11935835",
          "text": "Fueron testigos de un terrible accidente.",
          "translation": "Они стали свидетелями ужасной аварии.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11935835 @Eremon / #12165969 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11935835",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "testigos-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1534658",
          "text": "Deben ser muy viejos los testigos de Jehová.",
          "translation": "Свидетели Иеговы должны быть очень старыми.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1534658 @hayastan / #4792158 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1534658",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
