          "text": "Es nuestro tercer día en Boston.",
          "translation": "Это наш третий день в Бостоне.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6460083 @heo598 / #6459388 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6460083",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tercer-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1052028",
          "text": "Marzo es el tercer mes del año.",
          "translation": "Март - третий месяц года.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1052028 @hayastan / #5161615 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1052028",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tercer-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2259460",
          "text": "Ahora va a empezar el tercer acto.",
          "translation": "Сейчас начнётся третий акт.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2259460 @hayastan / #5533514 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2259460",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tercer-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9891714",
          "text": "Hoy es el tercer viernes de enero.",
          "translation": "Сегодня третья пятница января.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #9891714 @carlosalberto / #9891616 @carlosalberto (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9891714",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tercer-adj"
          ]
        }
