          "source": "Tatoeba #1347465 @Kiraness / #12203285 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1347465",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "precioso-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "856782",
          "text": "Nada es más precioso que el tiempo.",
          "translation": "Нет ничего более ценного, чем время.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #856782 @rafmen / #1499118 @heccele (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/856782",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "precioso-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "456560",
          "text": "Frente al parque hay un río precioso.",
          "translation": "Напротив парка красивая река.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #456560 @lukaszpp / #5341697 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/456560",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "precioso-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "B1"
      ],
