          "source": "Tatoeba #3932769 @gianich73 / #3932740 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3932769",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seria-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2057568",
          "text": "Siempre eres demasiado seria.",
          "translation": "Ты всегда чересчур серьёзная.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2057568 @marcelostockle / #5605320 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2057568",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seria-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2606528",
          "text": "Tuvimos una seria conversación.",
          "translation": "У нас состоялся серьёзный разговор.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2606528 @marcelostockle / #7731272 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2606528",
