          "source": "Tatoeba #346622 @tatoerique / #4328720 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/346622",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "social-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "14063817",
          "text": "Esto solo empeora la desigualdad social.",
