          "source": "Tatoeba #1507387 @marcelostockle / #5281209 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1507387",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "importaría-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2411393",
          "text": "¿Te importaría encender el fuego?",
