        "en": [
          "The second letter of the Spanish alphabet, called be and written in the Latin script."
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "8215912",
          "text": "No hay planeta B.",
          "translation": "У нас нет планеты Б.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8215912 @Adelpa / #10668009 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8215912",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
