        "en": [
          "The third letter of the Spanish alphabet, written in the Latin script."
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "1669627",
          "text": "¿Sabes programar en C?",
          "translation": "Ты умеешь программировать на C?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1669627 @wallebot / #5706493 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1669627",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "c-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "356074",
          "text": "Cristo nació el año 4 A.C.",
          "translation": "Христос родился в четвёртом году до нашей эры.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #356074 @tatoerique / #3041051 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/356074",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "c-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1118700",
          "text": "Las naranjas tienen mucha vitamina C.",
          "translation": "В апельсинах много витамина С.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1118700 @Shishir / #3122098 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1118700",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "c-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2839873",
          "text": "Los nombres de variables en C distinguen mayúsculas.",
          "translation": "Имена переменных в C регистрозависимы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2839873 @rainbyte / #2767133 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2839873",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "c-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2839868",
          "text": "Los nombres de variables en C son case sensitive.",
          "translation": "Имена переменных в C регистрозависимы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2839868 @rainbyte / #2767133 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2839868",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "c-character"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "B1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki es (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
