          "source": "Tatoeba #5614665 @baudelaire / #4706825 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5614665",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "veinte-num"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7251959",
          "text": "Tú tienes veinte años.",
